{
  "cues": [
    {
      "start_seconds": "0.000",
      "end_seconds": "3.760",
      "text": "On July 8, 1941, Fritz Schlieper,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "3.960",
      "end_seconds": "4.880",
      "text": "commander of the German"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "5.040",
      "end_seconds": "6.800",
      "text": "45th Infantry Division,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "6.880",
      "end_seconds": "7.840",
      "text": "signed a report on"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "7.920",
      "end_seconds": "9.800",
      "text": "the fighting for Brest-Litovsk."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "10.000",
      "end_seconds": "11.600",
      "text": "By then, the main centers"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "11.680",
      "end_seconds": "12.960",
      "text": "of organized resistance"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "13.040",
      "end_seconds": "14.160",
      "text": "inside the fortress"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "14.240",
      "end_seconds": "15.960",
      "text": "had already been crushed."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "16.160",
      "end_seconds": "17.120",
      "text": "The report listed"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "17.200",
      "end_seconds": "19.120",
      "text": "captured weapons, prisoners,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "19.240",
      "end_seconds": "21.120",
      "text": "and the division’s own losses."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "21.280",
      "end_seconds": "21.840",
      "text": "But among its"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "21.920",
      "end_seconds": "23.200",
      "text": "military conclusions"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "23.360",
      "end_seconds": "25.280",
      "text": "was a striking statement:"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "25.333",
      "end_seconds": "26.720",
      "text": "“An overwhelming assault"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "26.800",
      "end_seconds": "27.840",
      "text": "on a fortress held"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "27.920",
      "end_seconds": "29.800",
      "text": "by a brave defender costs"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "29.840",
      "end_seconds": "31.760",
      "text": "a great deal of blood.”"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "32.080",
      "end_seconds": "33.200",
      "text": "That was the assessment"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "33.280",
      "end_seconds": "34.560",
      "text": "of the man whose division"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "34.640",
      "end_seconds": "36.440",
      "text": "had stormed the fortress."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "36.720",
      "end_seconds": "37.360",
      "text": "What happened"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "37.440",
      "end_seconds": "38.840",
      "text": "behind those walls?"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "39.040",
      "end_seconds": "40.000",
      "text": "Why did the surprise"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "40.240",
      "end_seconds": "41.280",
      "text": "attack fail to bring"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "41.320",
      "end_seconds": "43.200",
      "text": "the resistance to a quick end?"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "43.280",
      "end_seconds": "44.480",
      "text": "And what does the familiar"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "44.560",
      "end_seconds": "46.320",
      "text": "claim that Brest Fortress held"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "46.400",
      "end_seconds": "47.680",
      "text": "out for more than a month"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "47.920",
      "end_seconds": "49.120",
      "text": "actually mean?"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "49.360",
      "end_seconds": "50.640",
      "text": "To understand that,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "50.720",
      "end_seconds": "51.680",
      "text": "we need to return"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "51.760",
      "end_seconds": "53.840",
      "text": "to the morning of June 22."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "54.320",
      "end_seconds": "57.680",
      "text": "At dawn on June 22, 1941,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "57.760",
      "end_seconds": "59.600",
      "text": "German artillery opened fire"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "59.680",
      "end_seconds": "60.960",
      "text": "on Brest Fortress."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "61.200",
      "end_seconds": "62.480",
      "text": "Shells exploded among"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "62.560",
      "end_seconds": "64.080",
      "text": "the barracks and warehouses."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "64.320",
      "end_seconds": "65.600",
      "text": "People were killed,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "65.680",
      "end_seconds": "66.800",
      "text": "fires broke out,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "66.880",
      "end_seconds": "67.840",
      "text": "and communications"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "67.880",
      "end_seconds": "68.800",
      "text": "and water supplies"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "68.880",
      "end_seconds": "69.800",
      "text": "were disrupted."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "70.000",
      "end_seconds": "71.600",
      "text": "The war caught more than just"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "71.680",
      "end_seconds": "73.440",
      "text": "soldiers inside the fortress."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "73.600",
      "end_seconds": "74.560",
      "text": "Officers’ families"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "74.600",
      "end_seconds": "76.080",
      "text": "were there too, including"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "76.160",
      "end_seconds": "77.360",
      "text": "women and children."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "77.760",
      "end_seconds": "78.640",
      "text": "Units from different"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "78.720",
      "end_seconds": "80.320",
      "text": "formations came under attack"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "80.360",
      "end_seconds": "81.360",
      "text": "at the same time."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "81.680",
      "end_seconds": "82.880",
      "text": "There was no unified"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "82.960",
      "end_seconds": "84.080",
      "text": "command of the defense"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "84.160",
      "end_seconds": "85.920",
      "text": "from the very first minutes."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "86.160",
      "end_seconds": "87.680",
      "text": "Some commanders were killed."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "87.840",
      "end_seconds": "88.800",
      "text": "Others were cut off"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "88.880",
      "end_seconds": "89.600",
      "text": "from their men."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "90.000",
      "end_seconds": "91.280",
      "text": "Some servicemen managed"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "91.360",
      "end_seconds": "92.480",
      "text": "to leave the fortress."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "92.800",
      "end_seconds": "94.160",
      "text": "Those who remained formed"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "94.240",
      "end_seconds": "95.440",
      "text": "small groups wherever"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "95.520",
      "end_seconds": "96.800",
      "text": "they could find weapons,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "96.880",
      "end_seconds": "98.400",
      "text": "shelter, and someone willing"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "98.480",
      "end_seconds": "99.640",
      "text": "to take command."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "99.920",
      "end_seconds": "101.520",
      "text": "German assault units quickly"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "101.600",
      "end_seconds": "102.880",
      "text": "broke into the fortress."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "103.040",
      "end_seconds": "104.240",
      "text": "But getting through the gates"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "104.360",
      "end_seconds": "105.680",
      "text": "was not the same as taking"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "105.760",
      "end_seconds": "107.920",
      "text": "control of the entire complex."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "108.160",
      "end_seconds": "109.520",
      "text": "Brest Fortress consisted"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "109.600",
      "end_seconds": "110.880",
      "text": "of several sections,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "110.960",
      "end_seconds": "113.040",
      "text": "separated by rivers, channels,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "113.080",
      "end_seconds": "114.600",
      "text": "and defensive earthworks."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "114.800",
      "end_seconds": "116.840",
      "text": "At its center stood the Citadel."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "117.040",
      "end_seconds": "118.400",
      "text": "Barracks, basements,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "118.480",
      "end_seconds": "120.000",
      "text": "and inner courtyards became"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "120.320",
      "end_seconds": "121.920",
      "text": "individual defensive positions."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "122.320",
      "end_seconds": "123.120",
      "text": "German soldiers"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "123.200",
      "end_seconds": "124.160",
      "text": "could advance,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "124.320",
      "end_seconds": "125.040",
      "text": "only to discover"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "125.120",
      "end_seconds": "126.320",
      "text": "that someone behind them"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "126.400",
      "end_seconds": "127.920",
      "text": "had started firing again."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "128.400",
      "end_seconds": "129.680",
      "text": "Near the Kholm Gate,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "129.800",
      "end_seconds": "130.880",
      "text": "Regimental Commissar"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "130.960",
      "end_seconds": "132.720",
      "text": "Efim Fomin was organizing"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "132.760",
      "end_seconds": "133.560",
      "text": "the defense."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "133.760",
      "end_seconds": "135.680",
      "text": "On the morning of June 22,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "135.760",
      "end_seconds": "137.280",
      "text": "he organized a counterattack"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "137.360",
      "end_seconds": "138.240",
      "text": "from the gate toward"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "138.320",
      "end_seconds": "139.680",
      "text": "the Red Army club, which"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "139.760",
      "end_seconds": "140.640",
      "text": "had been occupied"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "140.720",
      "end_seconds": "142.080",
      "text": "by German troops."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "142.160",
      "end_seconds": "143.680",
      "text": "The battle broke into dozens"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "143.760",
      "end_seconds": "144.720",
      "text": "of smaller fights"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "144.800",
      "end_seconds": "146.160",
      "text": "over individual buildings"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "146.240",
      "end_seconds": "147.520",
      "text": "and passageways."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "147.600",
      "end_seconds": "149.280",
      "text": "The defenders used rifles,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "149.480",
      "end_seconds": "151.360",
      "text": "machine guns, and grenades."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "151.440",
      "end_seconds": "152.240",
      "text": "When the two sides"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "152.320",
      "end_seconds": "153.600",
      "text": "came face to face,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "153.680",
      "end_seconds": "154.480",
      "text": "the fighting turned"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "154.560",
      "end_seconds": "156.320",
      "text": "into hand-to-hand combat."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "156.400",
      "end_seconds": "157.920",
      "text": "Under these conditions,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "158.000",
      "end_seconds": "159.680",
      "text": "larger pockets of resistance"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "159.760",
      "end_seconds": "161.680",
      "text": "gradually began to form."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "161.760",
      "end_seconds": "163.120",
      "text": "Inside the Citadel,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "163.160",
      "end_seconds": "164.880",
      "text": "a combined force operated"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "164.960",
      "end_seconds": "166.880",
      "text": "under Captain Ivan Zubachev"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "166.960",
      "end_seconds": "168.240",
      "text": "and Regimental Commissar"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "168.400",
      "end_seconds": "169.760",
      "text": "Efim Fomin."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "169.840",
      "end_seconds": "171.520",
      "text": "At the Kobrin Fortification,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "171.600",
      "end_seconds": "173.120",
      "text": "Major Pyotr Gavrilov"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "173.200",
      "end_seconds": "174.320",
      "text": "became one of the leaders"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "174.400",
      "end_seconds": "175.440",
      "text": "of the defense."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "175.520",
      "end_seconds": "177.040",
      "text": "His name would later become"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "177.440",
      "end_seconds": "178.560",
      "text": "particularly associated"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "178.640",
      "end_seconds": "180.160",
      "text": "with the Eastern Fort."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "180.240",
      "end_seconds": "181.520",
      "text": "But even with commanders"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "181.600",
      "end_seconds": "183.120",
      "text": "and headquarters in place,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "183.160",
      "end_seconds": "183.840",
      "text": "the defenders"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "184.040",
      "end_seconds": "185.600",
      "text": "still had no clear picture"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "185.680",
      "end_seconds": "186.560",
      "text": "of what was happening"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "186.640",
      "end_seconds": "188.080",
      "text": "beyond their positions."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "188.160",
      "end_seconds": "189.040",
      "text": "They did not know"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "189.160",
      "end_seconds": "190.720",
      "text": "where Soviet troops were,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "190.800",
      "end_seconds": "192.400",
      "text": "which roads were still open,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "192.520",
      "end_seconds": "193.360",
      "text": "or whether help"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "193.440",
      "end_seconds": "194.640",
      "text": "could be expected."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "194.720",
      "end_seconds": "196.880",
      "text": "The front was moving east."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "197.120",
      "end_seconds": "198.720",
      "text": "Behind the fortress walls,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "198.800",
      "end_seconds": "199.440",
      "text": "the defenders"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "199.520",
      "end_seconds": "200.800",
      "text": "continued fighting,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "200.920",
      "end_seconds": "202.400",
      "text": "surrounded by the enemy."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "202.640",
      "end_seconds": "204.320",
      "text": "The Bug and Mukhavets rivers"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "204.440",
      "end_seconds": "205.760",
      "text": "surrounded the fortress."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "205.920",
      "end_seconds": "208.000",
      "text": "On a map, water was close."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "208.160",
      "end_seconds": "209.040",
      "text": "But in battle,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "209.120",
      "end_seconds": "210.480",
      "text": "the distance to the riverbank"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "210.560",
      "end_seconds": "211.040",
      "text": "was measured"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "211.120",
      "end_seconds": "212.520",
      "text": "in more than meters."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "212.720",
      "end_seconds": "214.000",
      "text": "The approaches to the rivers"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "214.120",
      "end_seconds": "215.600",
      "text": "were under enemy fire."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "215.760",
      "end_seconds": "217.040",
      "text": "Anyone trying to collect"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "217.120",
      "end_seconds": "218.800",
      "text": "water had to leave cover,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "218.960",
      "end_seconds": "219.760",
      "text": "reach the water,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "219.880",
      "end_seconds": "221.200",
      "text": "and somehow make it back"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "221.280",
      "end_seconds": "222.640",
      "text": "while being shot at."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "222.800",
      "end_seconds": "223.760",
      "text": "After the water supply"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "223.840",
      "end_seconds": "225.120",
      "text": "system was damaged,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "225.200",
      "end_seconds": "226.080",
      "text": "thirst became one"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "226.160",
      "end_seconds": "227.200",
      "text": "of the most terrible"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "227.360",
      "end_seconds": "228.640",
      "text": "parts of the siege."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "228.720",
      "end_seconds": "230.160",
      "text": "Soldiers at their positions"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "230.240",
      "end_seconds": "231.200",
      "text": "suffered from it."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "231.240",
      "end_seconds": "232.080",
      "text": "So did the wounded"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "232.160",
      "end_seconds": "233.413",
      "text": "lying in basements,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "233.467",
      "end_seconds": "234.800",
      "text": "and the women and children"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "234.880",
      "end_seconds": "236.240",
      "text": "trapped inside."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "236.320",
      "end_seconds": "237.760",
      "text": "Smoke and fires made"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "238.120",
      "end_seconds": "239.600",
      "text": "conditions even worse."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "239.680",
      "end_seconds": "240.640",
      "text": "People tried to reach"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "240.720",
      "end_seconds": "241.760",
      "text": "the water under cover"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "241.840",
      "end_seconds": "242.800",
      "text": "of darkness."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "242.880",
      "end_seconds": "243.680",
      "text": "They used whatever"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "244.000",
      "end_seconds": "245.413",
      "text": "containers they could find."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "245.467",
      "end_seconds": "246.880",
      "text": "But even a nighttime trip"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "246.960",
      "end_seconds": "248.320",
      "text": "offered no guarantee"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "248.360",
      "end_seconds": "249.920",
      "text": "of returning alive."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "250.000",
      "end_seconds": "251.680",
      "text": "The wounded faced especially"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "251.800",
      "end_seconds": "253.040",
      "text": "desperate conditions."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "253.160",
      "end_seconds": "254.240",
      "text": "They needed water,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "254.320",
      "end_seconds": "256.400",
      "text": "bandages, and medical care."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "256.520",
      "end_seconds": "257.440",
      "text": "All of these became"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "257.640",
      "end_seconds": "259.920",
      "text": "increasingly difficult to obtain."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "260.080",
      "end_seconds": "261.280",
      "text": "Years later, this part"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "261.360",
      "end_seconds": "262.400",
      "text": "of the defense was given"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "262.520",
      "end_seconds": "263.440",
      "text": "a physical form"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "263.520",
      "end_seconds": "265.200",
      "text": "in the fortress memorial."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "265.280",
      "end_seconds": "267.200",
      "text": "A sculpture called “Thirst”"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "267.320",
      "end_seconds": "268.240",
      "text": "depicts a soldier"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "268.320",
      "end_seconds": "269.760",
      "text": "reaching toward the water,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "269.920",
      "end_seconds": "271.680",
      "text": "holding a helmet in his hand."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "271.840",
      "end_seconds": "272.720",
      "text": "People were suffering"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "272.800",
      "end_seconds": "273.840",
      "text": "from dehydration"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "273.920",
      "end_seconds": "275.680",
      "text": "within reach of a river."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "275.760",
      "end_seconds": "277.040",
      "text": "It remains one of the most"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "277.200",
      "end_seconds": "278.880",
      "text": "painful details of the defense"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "278.960",
      "end_seconds": "280.160",
      "text": "of Brest Fortress,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "280.240",
      "end_seconds": "281.120",
      "text": "and one that needs"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "281.200",
      "end_seconds": "282.747",
      "text": "no exaggeration."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "282.853",
      "end_seconds": "284.360",
      "text": "With every passing day,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "284.400",
      "end_seconds": "285.920",
      "text": "holding their positions became"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "286.000",
      "end_seconds": "287.680",
      "text": "harder for the defenders."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "287.800",
      "end_seconds": "288.400",
      "text": "Some supplies"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "288.480",
      "end_seconds": "289.520",
      "text": "had been destroyed during"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "289.600",
      "end_seconds": "290.680",
      "text": "the bombardment."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "290.720",
      "end_seconds": "292.120",
      "text": "Others were cut off."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "292.160",
      "end_seconds": "293.440",
      "text": "The fact that warehouses"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "293.520",
      "end_seconds": "295.280",
      "text": "existed inside the fortress"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "295.400",
      "end_seconds": "296.640",
      "text": "did not mean the defenders"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "296.720",
      "end_seconds": "297.440",
      "text": "could reach them"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "297.520",
      "end_seconds": "299.040",
      "text": "or transport what they needed"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "299.080",
      "end_seconds": "300.773",
      "text": "to their own positions."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "300.907",
      "end_seconds": "301.600",
      "text": "People searched for"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "301.680",
      "end_seconds": "303.040",
      "text": "surviving food supplies"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "303.120",
      "end_seconds": "304.160",
      "text": "and collected weapons"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "304.240",
      "end_seconds": "305.320",
      "text": "and ammunition."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "305.360",
      "end_seconds": "306.560",
      "text": "There was no reliable"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "306.760",
      "end_seconds": "308.000",
      "text": "supply system connecting"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "308.080",
      "end_seconds": "309.200",
      "text": "the scattered groups."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "309.280",
      "end_seconds": "310.320",
      "text": "Conditions could be"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "310.400",
      "end_seconds": "312.000",
      "text": "very different even between"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "312.080",
      "end_seconds": "313.440",
      "text": "neighboring buildings."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "313.520",
      "end_seconds": "315.280",
      "text": "The Germans used artillery,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "315.360",
      "end_seconds": "317.440",
      "text": "flamethrowers, and aircraft."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "317.520",
      "end_seconds": "319.413",
      "text": "Fortifications were destroyed,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "319.467",
      "end_seconds": "320.720",
      "text": "and individual positions"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "320.800",
      "end_seconds": "321.760",
      "text": "became isolated"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "321.840",
      "end_seconds": "322.880",
      "text": "from the others."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "323.000",
      "end_seconds": "325.200",
      "text": "By June 26, the main pockets"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "325.280",
      "end_seconds": "326.480",
      "text": "of resistance inside"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "326.560",
      "end_seconds": "328.480",
      "text": "the Citadel had been crushed."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "328.600",
      "end_seconds": "330.160",
      "text": "Efim Fomin was captured"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "330.280",
      "end_seconds": "332.240",
      "text": "and executed by the Germans."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "332.320",
      "end_seconds": "333.920",
      "text": "Ivan Zubachev was also"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "334.000",
      "end_seconds": "335.120",
      "text": "taken prisoner."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "335.200",
      "end_seconds": "337.040",
      "text": "He did not survive the war."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "337.120",
      "end_seconds": "337.600",
      "text": "He died in"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "337.640",
      "end_seconds": "340.160",
      "text": "a prison camp in 1944."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "340.200",
      "end_seconds": "341.920",
      "text": "At the Kobrin Fortification,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "342.000",
      "end_seconds": "342.800",
      "text": "the Eastern Fort"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "342.880",
      "end_seconds": "344.320",
      "text": "was still holding out."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "344.440",
      "end_seconds": "345.680",
      "text": "Its defenders were fighting"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "345.760",
      "end_seconds": "346.480",
      "text": "under the command"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "346.560",
      "end_seconds": "348.240",
      "text": "of Major Gavrilov."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "348.280",
      "end_seconds": "350.160",
      "text": "On June 29, after heavy"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "350.440",
      "end_seconds": "351.760",
      "text": "attacks, including strikes"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "351.840",
      "end_seconds": "353.280",
      "text": "from the air, the Germans"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "353.360",
      "end_seconds": "354.560",
      "text": "captured the fort."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "354.640",
      "end_seconds": "355.600",
      "text": "A large proportion"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "355.680",
      "end_seconds": "356.400",
      "text": "of the defenders"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "356.480",
      "end_seconds": "357.520",
      "text": "who remained inside"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "357.600",
      "end_seconds": "358.760",
      "text": "were taken prisoner."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "358.960",
      "end_seconds": "360.160",
      "text": "By the end of June,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "360.240",
      "end_seconds": "361.200",
      "text": "the main organized"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "361.280",
      "end_seconds": "362.720",
      "text": "defense of Brest Fortress"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "362.880",
      "end_seconds": "364.160",
      "text": "had come to an end."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "364.400",
      "end_seconds": "366.000",
      "text": "That distinction matters."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "366.160",
      "end_seconds": "367.200",
      "text": "It would be misleading"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "367.280",
      "end_seconds": "368.480",
      "text": "to imagine that the same"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "368.560",
      "end_seconds": "369.280",
      "text": "garrison held"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "369.360",
      "end_seconds": "370.480",
      "text": "the entire fortress"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "370.560",
      "end_seconds": "371.680",
      "text": "for more than a month,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "371.760",
      "end_seconds": "373.200",
      "text": "with a unified headquarters"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "373.280",
      "end_seconds": "374.160",
      "text": "and an unbroken"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "374.240",
      "end_seconds": "375.280",
      "text": "defensive line."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "375.440",
      "end_seconds": "377.600",
      "text": "In July, resistance continued"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "377.680",
      "end_seconds": "379.120",
      "text": "through individual soldiers"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "379.200",
      "end_seconds": "380.560",
      "text": "and small groups."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "380.680",
      "end_seconds": "381.440",
      "text": "Their situation"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "381.520",
      "end_seconds": "382.880",
      "text": "was very different."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "382.960",
      "end_seconds": "384.000",
      "text": "They had to find places"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "384.080",
      "end_seconds": "386.080",
      "text": "to hide, avoid searches,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "386.160",
      "end_seconds": "387.280",
      "text": "search for water,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "387.400",
      "end_seconds": "388.960",
      "text": "try to escape, or fight"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "389.040",
      "end_seconds": "390.320",
      "text": "if they were discovered."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "390.400",
      "end_seconds": "392.240",
      "text": "The single word “defense”"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "392.440",
      "end_seconds": "394.320",
      "text": "covers several distinct stages,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "394.360",
      "end_seconds": "395.760",
      "text": "and the very different fates"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "395.800",
      "end_seconds": "397.360",
      "text": "of the people involved."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "397.520",
      "end_seconds": "398.080",
      "text": "After the fall"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "398.120",
      "end_seconds": "399.360",
      "text": "of the Eastern Fort,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "399.440",
      "end_seconds": "400.880",
      "text": "Pyotr Gavrilov managed"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "400.920",
      "end_seconds": "402.800",
      "text": "to avoid immediate capture."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "402.880",
      "end_seconds": "403.920",
      "text": "He continued hiding"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "404.040",
      "end_seconds": "405.680",
      "text": "among the fortress structures."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "405.760",
      "end_seconds": "407.040",
      "text": "What we know about his final"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "407.200",
      "end_seconds": "408.560",
      "text": "weeks inside the fortress"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "408.720",
      "end_seconds": "410.240",
      "text": "comes mainly from testimony"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "410.280",
      "end_seconds": "411.760",
      "text": "and recollections recorded"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "411.920",
      "end_seconds": "412.960",
      "text": "after the war."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "413.080",
      "end_seconds": "414.160",
      "text": "That means the details"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "414.200",
      "end_seconds": "415.120",
      "text": "of those days need"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "415.160",
      "end_seconds": "415.760",
      "text": "to be treated"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "415.840",
      "end_seconds": "417.520",
      "text": "with particular caution."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "417.600",
      "end_seconds": "418.800",
      "text": "We cannot reconstruct"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "418.920",
      "end_seconds": "419.920",
      "text": "his every movement"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "420.000",
      "end_seconds": "422.160",
      "text": "or every exchange of gunfire."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "422.200",
      "end_seconds": "423.520",
      "text": "Gavrilov’s biography"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "423.600",
      "end_seconds": "426.400",
      "text": "gives July 23, 1941,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "426.480",
      "end_seconds": "428.000",
      "text": "as the date of his capture."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "428.080",
      "end_seconds": "429.280",
      "text": "It was the thirty-second"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "429.440",
      "end_seconds": "430.400",
      "text": "day of the war."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "430.560",
      "end_seconds": "431.920",
      "text": "He was taken prisoner,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "432.000",
      "end_seconds": "433.680",
      "text": "badly wounded and severely"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "433.840",
      "end_seconds": "435.440",
      "text": "weakened by exhaustion."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "435.520",
      "end_seconds": "436.640",
      "text": "Gavrilov survived"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "436.720",
      "end_seconds": "438.160",
      "text": "the Nazi prison camps,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "438.400",
      "end_seconds": "439.200",
      "text": "returned home,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "439.240",
      "end_seconds": "440.720",
      "text": "and was able to tell the story"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "440.800",
      "end_seconds": "442.400",
      "text": "of what he had experienced."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "442.520",
      "end_seconds": "443.560",
      "text": "His story became one"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "443.600",
      "end_seconds": "444.960",
      "text": "of the clearest examples"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "445.000",
      "end_seconds": "445.920",
      "text": "of how the collapse"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "445.960",
      "end_seconds": "447.120",
      "text": "of the major defensive"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "447.560",
      "end_seconds": "448.800",
      "text": "positions did not mean"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "448.920",
      "end_seconds": "449.920",
      "text": "that every defender"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "450.000",
      "end_seconds": "451.360",
      "text": "had immediately disappeared"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "451.440",
      "end_seconds": "452.640",
      "text": "from the fortress."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "452.680",
      "end_seconds": "453.440",
      "text": "But it would be too"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "453.560",
      "end_seconds": "454.480",
      "text": "definite to call him"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "454.560",
      "end_seconds": "456.000",
      "text": "the very last soldier"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "456.040",
      "end_seconds": "457.760",
      "text": "to remain among its ruins."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "457.840",
      "end_seconds": "459.200",
      "text": "The fates of many others"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "459.320",
      "end_seconds": "460.960",
      "text": "were never fully established."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "461.040",
      "end_seconds": "462.560",
      "text": "Now, let us return"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "462.600",
      "end_seconds": "463.960",
      "text": "to Schlieper’s report."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "464.160",
      "end_seconds": "465.280",
      "text": "In it, the divisional"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "465.360",
      "end_seconds": "466.640",
      "text": "commander acknowledged"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "466.680",
      "end_seconds": "467.600",
      "text": "the determination"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "467.640",
      "end_seconds": "469.120",
      "text": "of the Soviet soldiers,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "469.240",
      "end_seconds": "470.480",
      "text": "their infantry training,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "470.640",
      "end_seconds": "472.560",
      "text": "and their willingness to resist."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "472.720",
      "end_seconds": "474.240",
      "text": "He also examined why"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "474.320",
      "end_seconds": "475.840",
      "text": "the initial methods of assault"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "475.920",
      "end_seconds": "477.120",
      "text": "had failed to produce"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "477.200",
      "end_seconds": "478.600",
      "text": "the expected result."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "478.880",
      "end_seconds": "480.080",
      "text": "This was an internal"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "480.240",
      "end_seconds": "481.840",
      "text": "military document written"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "481.920",
      "end_seconds": "483.280",
      "text": "by the opposing side."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "483.600",
      "end_seconds": "484.960",
      "text": "Its author was explaining"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "485.040",
      "end_seconds": "486.720",
      "text": "the actions of his own division"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "486.880",
      "end_seconds": "488.160",
      "text": "and reviewing the outcome"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "488.200",
      "end_seconds": "489.120",
      "text": "of the operation."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "489.440",
      "end_seconds": "490.480",
      "text": "For that reason,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "490.600",
      "end_seconds": "491.840",
      "text": "each claim in the report"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "492.000",
      "end_seconds": "493.040",
      "text": "needs to be compared"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "493.120",
      "end_seconds": "494.240",
      "text": "with other accounts."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "494.560",
      "end_seconds": "496.400",
      "text": "Nevertheless, its recognition"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "496.480",
      "end_seconds": "497.200",
      "text": "of the defenders’"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "497.240",
      "end_seconds": "499.640",
      "text": "determination is unmistakable."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "499.920",
      "end_seconds": "501.040",
      "text": "According to the figures"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "501.120",
      "end_seconds": "502.240",
      "text": "given in the report,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "502.280",
      "end_seconds": "503.200",
      "text": "the division lost"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "503.360",
      "end_seconds": "506.400",
      "text": "453 men killed or missing,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "506.480",
      "end_seconds": "509.200",
      "text": "with another 668 wounded."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "509.320",
      "end_seconds": "510.080",
      "text": "These were the figures"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "510.160",
      "end_seconds": "511.280",
      "text": "reported for the fighting"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "511.360",
      "end_seconds": "512.720",
      "text": "around Brest-Litovsk"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "512.760",
      "end_seconds": "513.680",
      "text": "as a whole."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "513.760",
      "end_seconds": "515.440",
      "text": "They were not a verified,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "515.560",
      "end_seconds": "516.640",
      "text": "name-by-name count"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "516.720",
      "end_seconds": "517.840",
      "text": "of casualties suffered"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "517.960",
      "end_seconds": "518.960",
      "text": "exclusively within"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "519.040",
      "end_seconds": "520.480",
      "text": "the fortress walls."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "520.560",
      "end_seconds": "521.440",
      "text": "Soviet losses"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "521.560",
      "end_seconds": "523.280",
      "text": "were also enormous."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "523.360",
      "end_seconds": "524.640",
      "text": "Thousands of servicemen"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "524.760",
      "end_seconds": "526.800",
      "text": "were killed or taken prisoner."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "526.880",
      "end_seconds": "527.840",
      "text": "Some of the defenders"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "527.920",
      "end_seconds": "528.800",
      "text": "managed to escape"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "528.880",
      "end_seconds": "530.080",
      "text": "the encirclement."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "530.120",
      "end_seconds": "531.840",
      "text": "Brest Fortress did not stop"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "531.920",
      "end_seconds": "532.720",
      "text": "the main forces"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "532.800",
      "end_seconds": "533.520",
      "text": "of the Wehrmacht"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "533.600",
      "end_seconds": "535.040",
      "text": "from advancing east."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "535.120",
      "end_seconds": "535.600",
      "text": "For the people"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "535.680",
      "end_seconds": "537.040",
      "text": "who remained inside,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "537.120",
      "end_seconds": "538.480",
      "text": "that meant their own troops"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "538.560",
      "end_seconds": "540.000",
      "text": "were getting farther away,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "540.080",
      "end_seconds": "540.800",
      "text": "while their chances"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "540.880",
      "end_seconds": "541.840",
      "text": "of receiving help"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "541.920",
      "end_seconds": "543.800",
      "text": "grew smaller and smaller."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "544.000",
      "end_seconds": "544.720",
      "text": "And yet,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "544.880",
      "end_seconds": "546.400",
      "text": "under those circumstances,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "546.480",
      "end_seconds": "548.400",
      "text": "they continued to resist."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "548.480",
      "end_seconds": "549.360",
      "text": "Their determination"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "549.480",
      "end_seconds": "550.400",
      "text": "was so evident"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "550.480",
      "end_seconds": "551.600",
      "text": "that even the commander"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "551.680",
      "end_seconds": "552.800",
      "text": "of the division attacking"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "552.880",
      "end_seconds": "554.000",
      "text": "them felt compelled"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "554.040",
      "end_seconds": "555.040",
      "text": "to acknowledge it."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "555.280",
      "end_seconds": "556.320",
      "text": "After the war,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "556.360",
      "end_seconds": "557.760",
      "text": "an inscription was discovered"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "557.840",
      "end_seconds": "559.520",
      "text": "inside the ruined fortress."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "559.840",
      "end_seconds": "561.120",
      "text": "Its words would become one"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "561.200",
      "end_seconds": "562.160",
      "text": "of the most famous"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "562.240",
      "end_seconds": "563.760",
      "text": "testimonies of the defense:"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "564.160",
      "end_seconds": "565.360",
      "text": "“I am dying,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "565.440",
      "end_seconds": "567.040",
      "text": "but I will not surrender!"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "567.440",
      "end_seconds": "568.880",
      "text": "Farewell, Motherland.”"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "569.360",
      "end_seconds": "571.480",
      "text": "Beside those words was a date."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "571.680",
      "end_seconds": "574.480",
      "text": "July 20, 1941."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "574.560",
      "end_seconds": "575.680",
      "text": "The inscription was found"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "575.760",
      "end_seconds": "577.200",
      "text": "in a barracks building that,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "577.360",
      "end_seconds": "578.720",
      "text": "before the war, had housed"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "578.760",
      "end_seconds": "581.280",
      "text": "the 132nd Separate Battalion"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "581.360",
      "end_seconds": "583.800",
      "text": "of the NKVD Convoy Troops."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "584.000",
      "end_seconds": "585.200",
      "text": "The identity of the person"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "585.280",
      "end_seconds": "586.320",
      "text": "who left those words"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "586.400",
      "end_seconds": "587.040",
      "text": "has never been"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "587.120",
      "end_seconds": "588.560",
      "text": "reliably established."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "588.720",
      "end_seconds": "589.760",
      "text": "We do not know how"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "589.840",
      "end_seconds": "591.120",
      "text": "long he had been there,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "591.240",
      "end_seconds": "592.400",
      "text": "whether he was wounded,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "592.480",
      "end_seconds": "593.800",
      "text": "or whether he was alone."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "594.000",
      "end_seconds": "595.200",
      "text": "The inscription cannot"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "595.280",
      "end_seconds": "596.800",
      "text": "tell us his life story."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "596.960",
      "end_seconds": "598.320",
      "text": "It preserves only what"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "598.400",
      "end_seconds": "600.360",
      "text": "he himself wanted to say."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "600.560",
      "end_seconds": "601.600",
      "text": "The German general"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "601.680",
      "end_seconds": "602.880",
      "text": "left behind a report"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "602.920",
      "end_seconds": "603.760",
      "text": "on the fighting."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "603.920",
      "end_seconds": "605.600",
      "text": "An unknown defender left"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "605.680",
      "end_seconds": "607.440",
      "text": "a few words on a wall."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "607.680",
      "end_seconds": "608.880",
      "text": "“I am dying,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "608.960",
      "end_seconds": "610.560",
      "text": "but I will not surrender!"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": "610.960",
      "end_seconds": "612.320",
      "text": "Farewell, Motherland.”"
    }
  ]
}
